# Architecture — thepickleballcourt.ca

- Astro affiliate site. Domain: https://thepickleballcourt.ca (`site` in `astro.config.mjs`).
- Product source of truth: `src/data/gear.json`. Reference products by **ID only** — never duplicate product fields into articles or components.
- Extend existing files; do not rewrite from scratch.

## Keep working

| Path | Role |
|---|---|
| `Layout.astro` | Nav, canonical/OG/Twitter, Amazon footer disclosure |
| `ProductCard.astro` | Product display + affiliate CTA |
| `index.astro` | Homepage |
| `gear/[category].astro` | Paddles / shoes / nets |
| `src/content/articles` | MDX articles (typed content collection) |
| `src/components` | Reusable UI |
| `src/lib/seo.ts` | SEO / JSON-LD helpers |

## Protected routes

`/`, `/gear/paddles`, `/gear/shoes`, `/gear/nets`, `/sitemap-index.xml`
